---
const stats = [
  { target: 10, label: '年以上經驗' },
  { target: 50, label: '完成專案' },
  { target: 99, label: '系統可用性%' },
];

const skillCategories = [
  { title: '後端開發', tags: ['Python', 'Flask', 'FastAPI', 'Redis'] },
  { title: '前端開發', tags: ['JavaScript', 'HTML/CSS', 'PixiJS'] },
  { title: 'DevOps & SRE', tags: ['Docker', 'Pipeline', 'Nginx', 'ELK'] },
  { title: '自動化工具', tags: ['n8n workflow', 'Ansible', 'API intelligence'] },
];
---
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h2 class="section-title">關於我</h2>
      <div class="section-line"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h3>專業技術人員，致力於創新解決方案</h3>
        <p>
          身為一名IT SRE工程師，我專精於確保系統的高可用性與可靠性。
          擁有豐富的Web開發經驗，熟悉現代化的開發工具與流程。
        </p>
        <div class="skill-stats">
          {stats.map(({ target, label }) => (
            <div class="stat-item">
              <div class="stat-number" data-target={target}>0</div>
              <div class="stat-label">{label}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        {skillCategories.map(({ title, tags }) => (
          <div class="skill-category">
            <h4>{title}</h4>
            <div class="skill-tags">
              {tags.map((tag) => <span class="skill-tag">{tag}</span>)}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
